# Pull Through the Weft: both targets are "up to two" (CR 601.2c), so either group may be left empty. Faithless Looting (Mox Ruby)
# puts a Memnite and an Island in the graveyard; the Weft (Black Lotus's GGG, Mox Emerald and Mox Pearl) takes only a nonland card: the land group is left empty and the Island stays in the graveyard; Memnite returns to hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Memnite
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Plains
Plains
Pull Through the Weft
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Faithless Looting.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Memnite; Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pull Through the Weft.Cast
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Graveyard.Memnite)
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Pull Through the Weft; Black Lotus; Faithless Looting; Island
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Power = 1
